DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260921T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260921T200000
SUMMARY:Come Play Games at Gizmo
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\n**Come play games at Gizmo!**\n
 \n**5907 Triangle Dr\, Raleigh\, NC 27617**\n\n**One of the organizers wil
 l try and get there early and we will bring a couple of totes of games\; h
 owever\, if there is something you want to play please bring a copy.**\n\n
 **I'm not sure what the exact list will be\, but I know I'll bring Codesna
 mes\, Wizard\, and a couple of other staples. I'm trying to get a good lis
 t of games to include and would love to hear your ideas. Just leave them i
 n the comments and I'll bring what I can.**\n\n**Thanks\,**\n**Lance**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 315891859/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260729T173108Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T173108Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
